<Layout title="Order Terms | Home is Cookie" description="Home is Cookie order approval, deposits, minimums, delivery, packaging, and dietary information. Confirm final details before payment."><article class="wrap prose"><p class="eyebrow">PLEASE READ BEFORE ORDERING</p><h1>A few details,<br/><em>agreed together.</em></h1><p>An order request is not a confirmed booking. We review availability, product choices, artwork where relevant, pickup or delivery, and the final total before payment.</p><h2>Approval and payment</h2><p>Approved orders require a 50% non-refundable deposit. You may pay the full approved amount instead. The order confirmation will state the remaining balance and its due date. The deposit policy does not mean that all of a full payment is non-refundable.</p><h2>Minimums and timing</h2><p>Corporate boxes require a minimum of 10 boxes. Logo and photo cookies require at least 12 cookies; stuffed cookies and sandwich cookies each require at least six. Sharing trays contain 36 cookies. Corporate orders need at least two weeks’ notice and remain subject to date confirmation. Contact us about timing for regular orders.</p><h2>Pickup and delivery</h2><p>Ruskin-area pickup is arranged after confirmation. Regular delivery is $10 with a $20 minimum merchandise order, subject to address and date confirmation. Corporate delivery is quoted by order size and distance.</p><h2>Artwork and packaging</h2><p>Send the highest-resolution original artwork or image available and ensure you have permission to reproduce it. Printing and artwork setup are included for logo/photo cookies. Standard packaging is provided; custom packaging is not offered.</p><h2>Dietary concerns and care</h2><p>Dietary-specific accommodations are not offered. The kitchen may have exposure to soy, tree nuts, gluten, milk, and other allergens. Contact us before ordering about dietary concerns. We cannot promise an allergen-free product.</p><p>For freshness, enjoy cookies within three to five days. Refrigeration can dry cookies; follow any product-specific storage instructions supplied, especially for filled or frosted items.</p><h2>Changes to an order</h2><p>Contact us promptly about any change or cancellation request. Availability and any revised price must be confirmed. Additional cancellation, rescheduling, and quote-expiration terms are pending owner confirmation and must be settled before a live checkout is enabled.</p></article></Layout>
